OL,3,AHealey announces #100 energy payment
OL,4,Afor 20 million households in England as
OL,5,Ahe delivers Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FBanks will pay an extra 3% on the banks
OL,8,Fsurcharge, which will be
OL,9,F"time-limited", Healey says - a smaller
OL,10,Ftax rise than expected
OL,12,FA smaller rise in minimum wage for
OL,13,Fyoung workers is confirmed, with those
OL,14,Faged 18 to 20 seeing it go up by 3.9%
OL,16,FThere's a mixed outlook on the economy
OL,17,Ffrom the public finances watchdog -
OL,18,Fwith GDP expected to expand by 1.2%
OL,19,Fthis year, but next year it forecasts
OL,20,F1%, a sharp drop from earlier
OL,21,Fexpectations
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
